<title>RUSSIA: Russian Oct copper output up 19 pct month/month.</title>
<headline>Russian Oct copper output up 19 pct month/month.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's output of refined copper in October rose 19 percent on September and five percent on its year-ago level, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The committee provided the following data-</p>
<p>			   METALS OUTPUT IN OCTOBER 1996</p>
<p>			 month-on-month	  year-on-year</p>
<p>			 pct change		pct change</p>
<p> Primary aluminium	+6			  +3</p>
<p> Alumina		    +5			  -6</p>
<p> Rolled aluminium	+10			 -19</p>
<p> Nickel		     +4			 -11</p>
<p> Cobalt		     +8			 -36</p>
<p> Refined copper	  +19			  +5</p>
<p> Copper concentrate     +0.6		     -11</p>
<p> Gold			-13			 +11</p>
<p> Zinc			 +1			  +7</p>
<p>Note - The committee did not release absolute production figures.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
